question:
Suppose a circular array QUEUE has 6 memory locations. What are the values of front and REAR after the following operation? [BCS – 38th(ICT)]
a. Initially QUEUE is empty.
b. A, C and D are added to the queue;
c. F is inserted.
d. Two letters are deleted;
e. K, L and M are added to the queue;
f. Two letters are deleted and
R is added to the queue.
